    "notes": "Kyoto University publishes no itemised estimate of its own; its international-student guide cites JASSO averages. JASSO 2023 Lifestyle Survey of Privately-Financed International Students (令和5年度私費外国人留学生生活実態調査, table 7-4), Kinki region average monthly spending in ¥1,000s: housing 40 + utilities 7, food 32, commuting 4, personal = hobbies/leisure 7 + other daily costs 8. Excludes study/research costs (54, includes tuition) and insurance/medical (3)."
